    kind: work_item  # 83cf
    title: "Operations on an ALREADY-RUNNING child: python Popen.terminate/kill/send_signal are rowed subprocess against the dated WI-dupok ruling (signals are ipc_send), and reap/poll is rowed three different ways across c and python"  # 83cf
    status: todo_hard  # 83cf
    priority: 3  # 83cf
    parent:  # 83cf
    tags:  # 83cf
    - catalogue  # 83cf
    - io_boundary  # 83cf
