  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/iobcat2/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE. Re-checked 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e. (A) holds: python.yaml:1064 Popen [wait, poll, terminate, kill, send_signal] under subprocess; fixture io-boundaries shows Popen.terminate/kill/send_signal as subprocess while multiprocessing.Process.terminate is ipc_send. (B) changed: WI-lanos (397f2242e2, 2026-10-23, ADR-0049 Ruling 4) removed python os.wait* from ipc_recv (now unrowed, disclosed at python.yaml:1870) and rust Child.wait/try_wait; fixture os.waitpid reaches nothing. Reap is now rowed two ways: subprocess (c sys/wait, Popen.wait/poll) vs unrowed (os.wait*, multiprocessing join, rust Child.wait). MECHANISM: operations on an already-running child are rowed by catalogue section rather than by what crosses: signals under subprocess, reaps split between subprocess and unrowed. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-gurud."  # a55d
